    </answer>
  </question>

  <!-- Question 9: Hard - Tuple Unpacking Mismatch -->
  <question type="multichoice">
    <name>
      <text>S02.4.8: Tuple Unpacking Mismatch</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>What happens when you execute this code?</p><pre><code>point_3d = (10, 20, 5)
x, y = point_3d</code></pre>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <defaultgrade>1</defaultgrade>
    <single>true</single>
    <shuffleanswers>true</shuffleanswers>
    <answernumbering>abc</answernumbering>
    <answer fraction="100" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[A <code>ValueError</code> is raised because the number of variables does not match the number of items in the tuple.]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<code>x</code> becomes 10 and <code>y</code> becomes 20, with the 5 being ignored.]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[A <code>TypeError</code> is raised because you cannot unpack tuples this way.]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<code>x</code> becomes 10 and <code>y</code> becomes <code>(20, 5)</code>.]]></text>
    </answer>
  </question>

  <!-- Question 10: Hard - Sum of squares exercise -->
  <question type="multichoice">
    <name>
      <text>S02.2.11: Sum of Squares Exercise</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>You need to calculate the sum of the squares of the first 10 integers (1² + 2² + ... + 10²). Which code snippet correctly implements this?</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <defaultgrade>1</defaultgrade>
    <single>true</single>
    <shuffleanswers>true</shuffleanswers>
    <answernumbering>abc</answernumbering>
    <answer fraction="100" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<pre><code>total = 0
for i in range(1, 11):
    total += i * i</code></pre>]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<pre><code>total = 0
for i in range(10):
    total = i * i</code></pre>]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<pre><code>total = 0
for i in range(1, 10):
    total += i * i</code></pre>]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<pre><code>total = 1
for i in range(1, 11):
    total *= i * i</code></pre>]]></text>
    </answer>
  </question>
  
